      "system": {
        "description": {
          "gm": "",
          "value": "<p><strong>Wasted PotentIal:</strong><span class=\"pf2-icon\"> R</span> <strong>Trigger</strong> Haunted character enters room; Haunted character must make a @Check[type:will|dc:23|name:Suggestion|traits:mental,incapacitating,linguistic,necromancy,occult]save.&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>Critical success: </strong>the haunt has no effect,&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>Success:</strong> @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.e1XGnhKNSQIm5IXg]{Stupefied}1&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>Failure:</strong> @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.e1XGnhKNSQIm5IXg]{Stupefied}2&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure:</strong> @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.e1XGnhKNSQIm5IXg]{Stupefied}3.&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>This stupeﬁed condition diminishes by 1 after a full night's rest.</p>"
